        "Urea and ammonia plants in Port Harcourt buy natural gas by volume and sell fertiliser by tonne, with stoichiometric ratios setting both the feed rates and the emission estimates. Cement chemistry scales calcium carbonate decomposition the same way. A one percent error in feed ratio can waste millions of naira, which is why {S} stoichiometry is audited plant-wide.",
