        "Petroleum revenue built modern Nigeria, and it rests on delta geology: seismic surveys image traps, drilling confirms reservoirs, and reservoir engineers manage pressure and water cut over decades. Gas flaring, now being curtailed, is captured where compression and pipelines make the gas marketable. Each decision quotes the source-reservoir-seal logic of {S} petroleum geology.",
